SUMMARY:FERRE GOLA LIVE IN LONDON
LOCATION:Copper Box Arena\, Bethnal Green North West
DESCRIPTION:Ferre Gola\, one of the finest African and Congolese rumba arti
 
sts of his generation\, is renowned for his uniquely powerful and versatile
 
 voice\, as well as his masterful range of singing styles across the Democr
 
atic Republic of Congo and Central Africa. Now set to cement his legacy as 
 
an iconic figure of Congolese rumba\, Ferre Gola brings his sound to the UK
 
 with a live performance showcasing the very best of rumba\, soukous\, ndom
 
bolo\, and modern trap-rumba ? performed in the UK for the first time. This
 
 landmark concert follows the hugely successful release of his latest album
 
\, Dynasty\, which has seen Ferre Gola sell out major arenas across Africa 
 
and Europe. London audiences can now experience one of Africa?s most celebr
 
ated live performers in an unforgettable night of rhythm\, culture\, and mu
 
sical excellence at Copper Box Arena. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmas
 
ter.co.uk/ferre-gola-live-in-london-london-28-11-2026/event/35006430CF117F3
 
1
